{"ref":"BDB, שִׂמְלָה","hw":"שִׂמְלָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">שִׂמְלָה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. wrapper, mantle</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">שׂ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 9:23\" href=\"/Genesis.9.23\">Gn 9:23</a> +, cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׂמְלַת</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 21:13\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.21.13\">Dt 21:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 22:5\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.22.5\">22:5</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׂמְלָֽתְךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 8:4\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.8.4\">Dt 8:4</a>, etc.; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׂמָלֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 45:22\" href=\"/Genesis.45.22\">Gn 45:22</a><sup>(×2)</sup> +, sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">שִׂמְלֹתָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 44:13\" href=\"/Genesis.44.13\">44:13</a> +, etc.;—<em>wrapper, mantle</em> (of man or [<a data-ref=\"Ruth 3:3\" href=\"/Ruth.3.3\">Ru 3:3</a> +] woman), usually square piece of cloth worn as <em>outer garment</em> (v. Mackie<sup>Hast.DB i. 625</sup>; Benz<sup>Ency. Bib. iii. 2932</sup>), <a data-ref=\"Genesis 35:2\" href=\"/Genesis.35.2\">Gn 35:2</a> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 22:26\" href=\"/Exodus.22.26\">Ex 22:26</a> (both E), <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 8:4\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.8.4\">Dt 8:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 10:18\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.10.18\">10:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 21:13\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.21.13\">21:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 22:3\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.22.3\">22:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 3:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.3.6\">Is 3:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 3:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.3.7\">7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 9:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.9.4\">9:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 12:20\" href=\"/II_Samuel.12.20\">2 S 12:20</a> Kt, <a data-ref=\"Ruth 3:3\" href=\"/Ruth.3.3\">Ru 3:3</a> Kt (Qr in both pl.); as <em>covering</em> in sleep <a data-ref=\"Genesis 9:23\" href=\"/Genesis.9.23\">Gn 9:23</a> (J; cf. <a data-ref=\"Exodus 22:26\" href=\"/Exodus.22.26\">Ex 22:26</a>), bed-covering <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 22:17\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.22.17\">Dt 22:17</a>; covering or receptacle for articles <a data-ref=\"Exodus 12:34\" href=\"/Exodus.12.34\">Ex 12:34</a> (E), <a data-ref=\"Judges 8:25\" href=\"/Judges.8.25\">Ju 8:25</a> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 21:10\" href=\"/I_Samuel.21.10\">1 S 21:10</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 30:4\" href=\"/Proverbs.30.4\">Pr 30:4</a>; more gen. <em>garment</em>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 22:5\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.22.5\">Dt 22:5</a>, <em>clothes</em> (pl.) <a data-ref=\"Genesis 37:34\" href=\"/Genesis.37.34\">Gn 37:34</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 44:13\" href=\"/Genesis.44.13\">44:13</a> (J), <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:14\" href=\"/Genesis.41.14\">41:14</a> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 19:10\" href=\"/Exodus.19.10\">Ex 19:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 19:14\" href=\"/Exodus.19.14\">14</a> (all E), <a data-ref=\"Joshua 7:6\" href=\"/Joshua.7.6\">Jos 7:6</a> (JE), <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 4:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.4.1\">Is 4:1</a>; as costly gifts <a data-ref=\"Genesis 45:22\" href=\"/Genesis.45.22\">Gn 45:22</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 3:22\" href=\"/Exodus.3.22\">Ex 3:22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 12:35\" href=\"/Exodus.12.35\">12:35</a> (all E).","next":"BDB, שַׂמְלָה","prev":"BDB, שׂמל"}